    {
      "_key": "en",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "i4ww1iyje6sx",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The Town Of "
            },
            {
              "_key": "434g5cl0q8jk",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "yg4fl367kj4p"
              ],
              "text": "Marsa Alam"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "yg4fl367kj4p",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58885",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000009",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "1k2ecmuqjg33",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Perched at the pivotal junction where the ancient road from "
            },
            {
              "_key": "3m0qzmf2p2m0",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "1nxofdzxcx10"
              ],
              "text": "Edfu"
            },
            {
              "_key": "xm7228fm14x4",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " converges with the Red Sea coast, Marsa Alam is a town steeped in history. Constructed during the Greek period under "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000003"
              ],
              "text": "Ptolemy II"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", this route traverses through the Eastern Desert, past sites where the ancient Egyptians mined gold. The area is also celebrated for its intriguing rock inscriptions, dating back to the pre-dynastic era. These ancient graffiti, depicting ostrich hunting and various animals such as giraffes and cattle, offer a fascinating glimpse into "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000006"
              ],
              "text": "Egypt’s"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " distant past."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://www.livius.org/articles/person/ptolemy-ii-philadelphus/",
              "newTab": true
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/contact-us/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/contact",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "1nxofdzxcx10",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58841",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "From Sleepy Village to Bustling Resort"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000010",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Once a tranquil fishing village, Marsa Alam has undergone a remarkable transformation. The advent of the Marsa Alam International Airport catalyzed a tourism boom, propelling this serene town into the limelight as one of "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000d"
              ],
              "text": "Egypt’s"
            },
            {
              "_key": "py1fffzx568e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " fastest-growing holiday destinations. Poised to rival the popularity of famed resorts like "
            },
            {
              "_key": "t49kuyk31q6v",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "e4lrwu7cvq1c"
              ],
              "text": "Sharm el Sheikh"
            },
            {
              "_key": "wbemw1znlq0g",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " and "
            },
            {
              "_key": "w3nuox8kbw68",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "wwptd2mkf798"
              ],
              "text": "Hurghada"
            },
            {
              "_key": "lmtukjfbmmt5",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", Marsa Alam owes much of its allure to its status as the gateway to some of the southern Red Sea’s most breathtaking dive sites. This has made it a magnet for diving and snorkeling enthusiasts from around the globe."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/abu-simble-travel-guide/qasr-ibrim/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/guide/abu-simbel/qasr-ibrim",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "e4lrwu7cvq1c",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58927",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            },
            {
              "_key": "wwptd2mkf798",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58859",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000012",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The Underrated Charm of Marsa Alam"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Despite its growing popularity, Marsa Alam remains one of the region’s most underrated destinations. It is a "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000014"
              ],
              "text": "melting pot"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " of cultures, home to hotel workers from across Egypt, local Bedouins, miners from nearby gold mines, and traders providing essential services. The town, conveniently located "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000017"
              ],
              "text": "near many regional hotels"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", offers a variety of shops selling both necessities and souvenirs, a reasonably priced market, and a selection of modest yet clean restaurants and cafes. The warmth and genuine friendliness of the "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001a"
              ],
              "text": "locals towards visitors"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " add to the town’s inviting atmosphere."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/port-said-travel-guide/melting-pot/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/guide/port-said/port-said-historical-guide",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/sinai-desert-safaris/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/blog/shinai-no-sabaku-o-aruku-hashiru-koeru",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/egyptian-museum-and-bazaar-tour/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/egyptian-museum-and-bazaar-tour",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A Modern Town with a Lively Evening Pulse "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000021",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "While Marsa Alam may lack the architectural charm of more ancient Egyptian towns, it possesses a modern, functional beauty. During the heat of midday, the town often takes on the quietude of a ghost town, but as evening approaches and the temperature cools, it transforms. The streets come alive with the returning working population, creating a vibrant, lively atmosphere that contrasts with its daytime serenity."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000022",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/pascal-van-de-vendel-CNdMGaVEozQ-unsplash-1.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Colorful fish swimming among coral and anemones on a reef"
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Nature's underwater mosaic in brilliant colors"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000023",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/geoff-trodd-7lsPi2Znk_M-unsplash-1.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Close-up image of a colorful underwater reef with tiny fish and marine life"
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Marine tapestry - where life thrives in a mosaic of coral"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "es",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "9g0rzc8vh9qs",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "La ciudad de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "24c005lw1acf",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "vsl64a3jmn1g"
              ],
              "text": "Marsa Alam"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "vsl64a3jmn1g",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58885",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "33go9cf90q7p",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Enclavada en el cruce donde la antigua carretera de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "2aiz0x9jt1gt",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "g5fpdlr6or0z"
              ],
              "text": "Edfu"
            },
            {
              "_key": "y6aphyha86vm",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " converge con la costa del Mar Rojo, Marsa Alam es una ciudad cargada de historia."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Construida durante el periodo griego bajo "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000005"
              ],
              "text": "Ptolomeo II"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", esta ruta atraviesa el Desierto Oriental, pasando por lugares donde los antiguos egipcios extraían oro."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "La zona también es célebre por sus intrigantes inscripciones rupestres, que se remontan a la época predinástica."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Estos antiguos graffiti, que representan la caza del avestruz y diversos animales como jirafas y ganado, ofrecen una fascinante visión del pasado remoto de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000c"
              ],
              "text": "Egipto"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ptolomeo_II",
              "newTab": true
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-abu-simble/el-templo-de-amada/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/guide/abu-simbel/el-templo-de-amada",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "g5fpdlr6or0z",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58841",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000011",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "De pueblo dormido a centro turístico bullicioso"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000025",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Antaño un tranquilo pueblo de pescadores, "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000013"
              ],
              "text": "Marsa Alam"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " ha experimentado una notable transformación."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "La "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000018"
              ],
              "text": "llegada del Aeropuerto"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Internacional de Marsa Alam catalizó un auge del turismo, impulsando a esta serena ciudad hacia el centro de atención como uno de los destinos vacacionales egipcios de más rápido crecimiento."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A punto de rivalizar con la popularidad de famosos centros turísticos como "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001d"
              ],
              "text": "Sharm el Sheij"
            },
            {
              "_key": "yqstwen8kaip",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " y "
            },
            {
              "_key": "bt64fne06084",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "x9gzjji4bhno"
              ],
              "text": "Hurghada"
            },
            {
              "_key": "7vc2hkacz34x",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", Marsa Alam debe gran parte de su atractivo a su condición de puerta de entrada a algunos de los lugares de buceo más impresionantes del sur del Mar Rojo."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000021",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Esto la ha convertido en un imán para los entusiastas del buceo y "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000023",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "el submarinismo de"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000024",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " todo el mundo."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/maravillas-marinas-aventura-de-snorkel-en-grupo-en-marsa-alam/"
              },
